# Rules vs notes (scope)

- **Rules** = how; **notes** (`notes/_timeline_vst.md`) = what/now.
- Never duplicate tables or dynamic counts from notes into rules; point to the note path.
- Superseded rules: update or remove immediately.

| Add to | When |
| :--- | :--- |
| `.cursor/rules/` | Recurring protocols, hard guardrails, SoT mapping |
| `.cursor/skills/` | Auto-discovered workflows (e.g. `grill-me`) |
| `.cursor/commands/` | `@`-invoked ops runbooks (e.g. `@push-submodule`, `@flash-gv2`); git-tracked |
| `notes/` | Dataset counts, run history, pinouts, daily-changing content |
| `README.md` | Public GitHub voice only; **agent never edits local `README.md` on disk** without explicit user request (`agent-persona.mdc`). No sync/revert/cleanup. Baseline `c72a5e0` (2026-06-08). No gitignored dirs, `@commands`, or local mirror workflow |

## Public vs local (agent)

| Public (README, GitHub) | Local (rules / commands / skills / notes) |
| :--- | :--- |
| Notebook repo + `.ipynb` blob URLs on GitHub | `@sync-colab-notebooks` → gitignored `notebooks/` |
| Submodule clone URLs | `gv2_firmware/` branch pin, flash runbooks |
| | `notes/`, `docs/teaching/`, `weights_dataset_for_GCE/` |
